# INACTIVE proposal, never execute generation during the source-only hold.
# Input: kernel/ucount_native_bindings.h with pinned configured native flags.
# Proposed destination: kernel::bindings::ucount_native. No shared recipe added.
# All types are header-derived, including by-value kuid_t and native enum widths.
# Do not blocklist, handwrite or replace layouts. Rust does not project fields.
# Native wrappers own all public/callback/init indirect-call type metadata;
# the Rust bodies are direct-call targets. No guessed CFI encodings are added.
--no-doc-comments
--no-default '.*'
--no-prepend-enum-name
--newtype-global-enum '^(ucount_type|rlimit_type)$'
--allowlist-type '^(ucounts|user_namespace|kuid_t|ucount_type|rlimit_type|atomic_long_t|hlist_nulls_head|hlist_nulls_node|ctl_table_root|ctl_table_set|ctl_table_header|ctl_table)$'
--allowlist-function '^lupos_ucount_.*$'
--allowlist-var '^(init_ucounts|LUPOS_UCOUNT_.*)$'
